WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.336
Welcome to the Evidence Archive.

00:00:02.336 --> 00:00:08.220
Everything here is mathematical proof — derived from the government's own published data.

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:13.845
Seven million government records have been cross-referenced across six public databases.

00:00:13.845 --> 00:00:19.266
Fifty-seven megabytes of raw lobbying data, analyzed line by line.

00:00:19.266 --> 00:00:24.565
Three thousand, one hundred and eighty subject matter tags, decoded.

00:00:24.565 --> 00:00:32.866
The compound annual growth rate of MAID deaths from 2016 to 2024 is forty-one point seven percent.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:40.652
At that trajectory, the cumulative toll will exceed one hundred thousand Canadians by the end of 2026.

00:00:40.652 --> 00:00:48.451
The government valued each life eliminated at one thousand, nine hundred and fifty-four dollars in healthcare savings.

00:00:48.451 --> 00:00:52.907
A burial coffin costs more than what they saved by killing you.

00:00:52.907 --> 00:01:00.054
Every formula on these pages can be verified with a calculator and the Government of Canada's own reports.

00:01:00.054 --> 00:01:02.024
The math does not lie.
